# Inpriv — Cloudflare Pages redirects
# Each tool is served as a subdomain (e.g., wipe.inpriv.xyz → .wipe/index.html)
# Subdomain routing is handled by Cloudflare DNS + Pages, not here.
# This file handles path-based access fallbacks.

# Redirect / to the landing page (index.html already serves there)
# No redirect needed — index.html IS the landing page

# Security: block dotfile access in case any leak through
# .env, .git, etc. are gitignored but defense in depth
/.env* /404.html 404
/.git* /404.html 404
/.DS_Store /404.html 404
